sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Browser
  participant CDN
  participant API
  participant Cache
  participant DB
  participant Queue
  User->>Browser: click dashboard
  Browser->>CDN: GET /dashboard
  CDN-->>Browser: HTML shell
  Browser->>API: GET /api/summary
  API->>Cache: read summary
  Cache-->>API: miss
  API->>DB: select account metrics
  DB-->>API: rows
  API->>Cache: store summary
  API->>Queue: emit viewed_dashboard
  API-->>Browser: 200 JSON
  Browser-->>User: paint metrics
  Note over API,Queue: async analytics never blocks response
